# CORIDE app status

Updated: 2026-11-13

## Current state

- Django app is registered in `config/settings.py`.
- `/` renders the CoRide landing placeholder.
- `views.py` provides a shared `module_page()` renderer used by all module placeholders.
- `templates/coride/module.html` contains the shared responsive placeholder layout.
- The shared kitty image is served from `assets/kitty.png` and is also used as the page favicon.
- No business models, authentication flow, navigation, or production feature pages are implemented.

## Changes so far

- Scaffolded the app with Django's `startapp` command.
- Added the home route and shared placeholder renderer.
- Added screenshots of the currently rendered home page and module placeholders.

